{"asset_key":"timeline/env_story_11202340","episode":"timeline","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120232001:":{"text":"장례식이 곧 시작되는데...","source_cn":"奥格的葬礼就快开始了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x160DBFF26C2B254A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120232002:":{"text":"소렌은 무슨 생각이래?","source_cn":"他，会过来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B3D0A9BAB7AF51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120232003:":{"text":"소렌이 올바른 결정을 내릴 거라고 믿어.","source_cn":"我相信索恩会做出正确的决定。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5CC2C3535F7393B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"소렌이 올바른 결정을 내릴 거라고 믿어.","female":"소렌이 올바른 결정을 내릴 거라고 믿어.","variant_male_record_index":"118426","variant_female_record_index":"118427","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120233001:":{"text":"소렌, 왔구나!","source_cn":"索恩，你果然来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EDCB6121DC65C15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120233002:":{"text":"올 줄 알았다.","source_cn":"我知道你会来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x542A14AC6DE9B783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120234001:0":{"text":"소렌은 자기도 어떤 선택을 할지 모르겠다고 했었어.","source_cn":"索恩说，连他自己都不确定到时候会做出什么样的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CF444F4C15BD5D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120234002:0":{"text":"그래도 소렌이라면 분명 계획을 세워뒀을 거야.","source_cn":"不过没关系啦，他应该有自己的计划。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE718E47554DB87B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120234003:1":{"text":"어! 블랙하울 사람들이 오우거의 유해를 들고 가네…","source_cn":"啊！那些黑嚎族人把奥格抬走了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E5263D17F2B4E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120234004:2":{"text":"블랙하울 부족의 풍습이야. 족장의 장례식을 치르면 부족원들이 족장의 유해를 사막에 들고 가지.","source_cn":"这是黑嚎氏族的风俗。族长的葬礼，会由族民们抬着他进入流...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC829F795362C38F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120234005:1":{"text":"그리고 유사지대의 한가운데에 유해를 놓아 모래와 함께 사막의 가장 깊은 곳에 잠들게 하지.","source_cn":"然后把他放在流沙中心，让金黄的流沙包裹着他，一同到达沙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x359DF1D31B7A660B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120234006:1":{"text":"우리 블랙하울 부족은 사막에서 자랐으니, 죽어도 사막에 묻히는 셈이야. 사막은 사람을 가리지 않으니까.","source_cn":"黑嚎氏族生于沙漠，也终将葬于沙漠。流沙会吞噬一切，不分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE291D43CE28B35B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120234007:1":{"text":"이제 모든 것이 끝났군. 오우거가 사막에서는 편히 쉴 수 있기를…","source_cn":"不过现在一切都结束了。希望他能在这片沙漠之中安息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE751B15A5C224B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120234008:1":{"text":"마스터, 보세요! 쿠긴이 오우거의 몸에 뭔가 걸어두고 있어요.","source_cn":"主人你看，库金好像把什么东西挂在了奥格身上……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE53DE4C7FEEE94BE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 보세요! 쿠긴이 오우거의 몸에 뭔가 걸어두고 있어요.","female":"마스터, 보세요! 쿠긴이 오우거의 몸에 뭔가 걸어두고 있어요.","variant_male_record_index":"118435","variant_female_record_index":"118436","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120234009:1":{"text":"저게 쿠긴이 말했던 명복의 목걸이인가요?","source_cn":"那个莫非就是库金之前说的护途之链？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E662C229FBBBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120234010:0":{"text":"맞네. 저 자리에 소렌이 있었어도 똑같은 일을 해야 했을 걸세.","source_cn":"嗯。如果索恩在的话，他也需要做一样的事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F2B9453C62B7735","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1120232001:":{"text":"장례식이 곧 시작되는데...","source_cn":"奥格的葬礼就快开始了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x160DBFF26C2B254A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1120232002:":{"text":"소렌은 무슨 생각이래?","source_cn":"他，会过来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B3D0A9BAB7AF51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1120232003:":{"text":"소렌이 올바른 결정을 내릴 거라고 믿어.","source_cn":"我相信索恩会做出正确的决定。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5CC2C3535F7393B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"소렌이 올바른 결정을 내릴 거라고 믿어.","female":"소렌이 올바른 결정을 내릴 거라고 믿어.","variant_male_record_index":"118426","variant_female_record_index":"118427","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1120233001:":{"text":"소렌, 왔구나!","source_cn":"索恩，你果然来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EDCB6121DC65C15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1120233002:":{"text":"올 줄 알았다.","source_cn":"我知道你会来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x542A14AC6DE9B783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120234011:0":{"text":"물건을 주인에게 돌려주려는 것뿐이야.","source_cn":"我只是希望物归原主而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD8652518BEC4E58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120234012:1":{"text":"…부장품도 다 갖춰졌으니 시작하지.","source_cn":"……陪葬品齐全了。我们开始吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5981391587AD986B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120234013:0":{"text":"오우거는… 이제 완전히 사라졌어.","source_cn":"奥格……已经完全消失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x028139A1BF1C7711","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120234014:0":{"text":"사막은 모든 것을 삼킨다라…","source_cn":"沙漠会吞噬一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC5CC62577644CA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1120234015:0":{"text":"왠지 모르게 마음이 허전해…","source_cn":"不知道为什么，总感觉心里空落落的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA710ED1D629DB8C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1120234016:1":{"text":"블랙하울의 족장이자 나의 아버지, 오우거의 장례식에 참석해 줘서 고맙다.","source_cn":"各位，感谢你们如约出席黑嚎族长，我的父亲，奥格的葬礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAA950D1A2DFE6D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1120234017:1":{"text":"만약 시간이 된다면 저녁에 우리 부족과 함께…","source_cn":"如果你们之后有空的话，晚上我们还有一场族内的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CEA64BD9C91314A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1120234018:1":{"text":"됐어. 우린 이만 돌아가겠어. 앞으로도 볼 일 없을 거야.","source_cn":"时候不早，我们已经准备回去了。之后应该也不会再见了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23D316DE952919F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1120234019:0":{"text":"그게… 그러니까 소렌의 뜻은… 장례식에서 도와줘서 고맙다는 뜻일 거예요. 또 봐요!","source_cn":"呃，索恩的意思是……感谢你在葬礼上的帮助，我们有缘再见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2762FBBEB7E124C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1120234019":{"text":"그게… 그러니까 소렌의 뜻은… 장례식에서 도와줘서 고맙다는 뜻일 거예요. 또 봐요!","source_cn":"呃，索恩的意思是……感谢你在葬礼上的帮助，我们有缘再见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2762FBBEB7E124C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1120234020:0":{"text":"…그래. 그럼 나중에 또 보지.","source_cn":"……我明白了。各位，再会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE99397FE2A5998B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"네가 원하면 우리도 참석 안 할게","source_cn":"我们可以陪你一起离开","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2E73A284A4ACD1A7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 원하면 우리도 참석 안 할게","female":"네가 원하면 우리도 참석 안 할게","variant_male_record_index":"62966","variant_female_record_index":"62967","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:1:2":{"text":"지금 떠나도 늦지 않았어","source_cn":"现在离开，应该还来得及","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC007A18FC5D0054A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"지금 떠나도 늦지 않았어","female":"지금 떠나도 늦지 않았어","variant_male_record_index":"62968","variant_female_record_index":"62969","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:33:11010203:0":{"text":"소렌은 결국 오우거의 장례식에 참석했다.","source_cn":"索恩最终还是出席了奥格的葬礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FCF44E69B0334B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:34:11010202:0":{"text":"오우거의 장례가 시작되려는데, 소렌은 여전히 나타나지를 않고 있다.","source_cn":"奥格的葬礼就要开始了，索恩却迟迟没有出现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42F4D7B6492D0592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:库金":{"text":"쿠긴","source":"库金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主角":{"text"